{"symbol":"TRR.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:58:18Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Wojska Polskiego 2i","city":"Jaworzno","zip":"43-603","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 614 0056","fax":"48 32 615 0330","website":"https://termo-rex.pl","industry":"Building Materials","industryKey":"building-materials","industryDisp":"Building Materials","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Termo-Rex S.A. provides heat treatment solutions in Poland and internationally. The company offers personal protective equipment, including masks, overalls, safety goggles, visors, surgical sets, aprons, and shoe protectors; and mobile and furnace heat treatment. It also engages in the leasing of resistance and induction heating equipment and mobile modular heat treatment furnace, as well as resistance heating mats, distributors, cables, and welding machines for pins and thermocouples; warehousing of electric system products; and manufacturing of accessories, resistance heaters, and heating mats. In addition, the company is involved in the extraction and sale of microspheres; assemblies, upgrades, and overhauls; and supply of thermal insulation, technical ceramic products, and electrical system products. It serves power, petrochemical, and shipbuilding industries. The company was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Jaworzno, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":31,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jacek  Jussak","title":"President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2020,"totalPay":210000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Barbara  Krakowska","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2020,"totalPay":102000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Jaroslaw  Zemla","title":"Vice President of Management Board","fiscalYear":2020,"totalPay":102000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1609372800,"executiveTeam":[